file tools/fixtures/r/reds_pin_capacity_scan.sh prints pin_held_rows, one detail line per held row, and the three doors at the wall
file tools/fixtures/r/reds_pin_capacity_control.sh nine legs proving the reading and the doors line from both sides
file construction/archive/REDS-the-door-nobody-meets-at-the-wall-rows-698.md the row, born on its shelf, BOOKED
file construction/archive/REDS-fold-recital.md the trail line for that birth
file construction/REDS.md headline span regenerated to match the measured spine
file construction/archive/20260910-070937_itinerary-landed-accounts.md the one depth-lost link, repointed
