scope law lane -- the REDS ledger, its capacity meter, and the living card
status GREEN -- reds_pin_capacity, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_status_consistency, reds_shelf_name, reds_citation, reds_spine_derive, unshared_citation, fold_shelf_link, fold_shelf_link_repoint, itinerary_account_shelf, living_card_ascii, e123_living_pin_guard all green on metal; hot roster pass named in the account
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- one word on the ledger's three doors, not a sixth ask. Only splitting OPEN by who holds a row removes the cause; until then every ship spends a lap re-deriving what an essay already costed.
